  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Döngüde her `i` için `(i * size, (i + 1) * size)`; son parçada bitişi `n` yap.",
      "en": "In the loop, `(i * size, (i + 1) * size)` for each `i`; for the last piece make the stop `n`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Son parça mı: `i == parts - 1`.",
      "en": "Is it the last piece: `i == parts - 1`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef split_range(n, parts):\n    size = n // parts\n    pieces = []\n    for i in range(parts):\n        start = i * size\n        stop = n if i == parts - 1 else (i + 1) * size\n        pieces.append((start, stop))\n    return pieces\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef split_range(n, parts):\n    size = n // parts\n    pieces = []\n    for i in range(parts):\n        start = i * size\n        stop = n if i == parts - 1 else (i + 1) * size\n        pieces.append((start, stop))\n    return pieces\n```"
    }
  ],
